  "voice": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "text": "Meet Aisha, the money assistant inside Wavvy Wallet.",
      "start": 0.45,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/i1.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "text": "Ask her anything, in plain words. Here are six things she can do for you.",
      "start": 4.9,
      "duration": 5.32,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/i2.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "h1",
      "text": "To find her, open Wavvy Wallet, and tap Chat at the bottom.",
      "start": 11.37,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/h1.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "h2",
      "text": "The first time, read the short note, then tap, Continue to chat.",
      "start": 16.14,
      "duration": 4.74,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/h2.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "text": "Let's start with number one.",
      "start": 22.03,
      "duration": 1.94,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/i4.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1q",
      "text": "Number one. Ask Aisha about your spending.",
      "start": 25.34,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1a",
      "text": "Type a question, like, how much did I spend this month? Then tap send.",
      "start": 29.61,
      "duration": 6.14,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1b",
      "text": "Aisha adds it all up in seconds, and shows how much is still untagged.",
      "start": 36.2,
      "duration": 4.62,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c1c",
      "text": "Ask where most of your money goes, and she names your biggest costs.",
      "start": 41.27,
      "duration": 3.66,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c1c.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c2q",
      "text": "Number two. Find any payment, fast.",
      "start": 46.08,
      "duration": 3.5,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c2q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c2a",
      "text": "Ask about anyone you pay. Show me my payments to Mary Wanjiku.",
      "start": 50.73,
      "duration": 5.02,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c2a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c2b",
      "text": "She finds every payment, with the dates and fees, and even spots a pattern.",
      "start": 56.2,
      "duration": 5.1,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c2b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3q",
      "text": "Number three. Tag payments, just by chatting.",
      "start": 62.45,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c3q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3a",
      "text": "Tell her what a payment was for. Tag the Kings Court payment as rent.",
      "start": 67.36,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c3a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3b",
      "text": "Aisha always asks before she changes anything. Tap, Allow Once.",
      "start": 72.85,
      "duration": 5.06,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c3b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c3c",
      "text": "Done. Your rent is tagged, and she offers to do it every month.",
      "start": 78.36,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c3c.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c4q",
      "text": "Number four. Cash spending counts too.",
      "start": 83.87,
      "duration": 3.34,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c4q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c4a",
      "text": "Paid with cash? Just tell her. I paid two hundred and fifty shillings cash for lunch.",
      "start": 88.36,
      "duration": 6.28,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c4a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c4b",
      "text": "Allow it, and the cash payment is added to your list.",
      "start": 95.09,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c4b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c5q",
      "text": "Number five. Plan ahead with Aisha.",
      "start": 99.92,
      "duration": 3.08,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c5q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c5a",
      "text": "Ask her to plan a weekend trip to Diani, with twenty thousand shillings.",
      "start": 104.15,
      "duration": 4.86,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c5a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c5b",
      "text": "She splits it into transport, a place to stay, food, activities, and a little extra, and checks it against your usual spending.",
      "start": 109.46,
      "duration": 8.72,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c5b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c5c",
      "text": "Say yes, and she creates a trip category, so you can track every shilling.",
      "start": 118.63,
      "duration": 4.88,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c5c.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c6q",
      "text": "And number six. Aisha can change the app, and listen too.",
      "start": 124.66,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c6q.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c6a",
      "text": "Ask for a purple theme, and the whole app changes colour.",
      "start": 130.45,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c6a.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c6b",
      "text": "Ask for green again, and it's back.",
      "start": 134.5,
      "duration": 2.28,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c6b.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "c6c",
      "text": "Rather talk than type? Tap the microphone, and just speak.",
      "start": 137.23,
      "duration": 3.98,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/c6c.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "o1",
      "text": "Aisha is in beta, so double check anything important. Open Wavvy Wallet, tap Chat, and say hello.",
      "start": 142.36,
      "duration": 7.44,
      "src": "assets/audio/story/o1.wav",
      "volume": 1.4
    }
  ],
